3: // Phase 6 - the measured accessibility tasks (T136, T137, T140).
4: //
5: // All three were measured with `scripts/visual/probe-metrics.cjs` against the
6: // BUILT renderer, offscreen, over 8 routes:
7: //
8: //   T137  contrast, 3 themes: 131 distinct failures -> 0. Orbital and
9: //         High-contrast went 15 -> 0 each; Solar Light 101 -> 0.
10: //   T136  announcement order: every route now has exactly one h1 and no
11: //         skipped heading level. Workspace previously announced a single
12: //         alert and no structure at all.
13: //   T140  keyboard reach at 800x680, the production minimum: 0 unreachable
14: //         controls on every route, and History no longer overflows a
15: //         container that cannot be scrolled to reach it.
16: //
17: // These tests lock the CAUSES so the numbers cannot quietly come back.
